{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Click to Punch</strong> is a fast-paced, absurd clicker game where you punch a bag, make it cry and use its tears to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <strong>John Punch</strong> (the guy who invented punching\u00a0trust me on that) and unleash a barrage of blows to upgrade your strength, unlock powerful abilities, and recruit Lil\u2019 John Punch to punch for you when you're too busy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your punches, collect rare tears, prestige for shiny titles, and <i>MAYBE</i> help the punching bag find peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Fast, satisfying clicker gameplay</strong><br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Tear-powered upgrades and special abilities</strong><br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Absurd art and music</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>JJBA (John John Bizzarre Adventures) references </strong><br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A lil\u2019 buddy who punches for you in and out of game</strong><br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Cosmetics (yay)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love clicking and punching, you may want to... <strong>Click to Punch</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708670?t=1746210581","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708670/771a92433021fd9e057ce606118d3bcd1499611b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746210581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708670/0a17f92845f477613e09ba916ffafd72db7348db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746210581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708670/0a17f92845f477613e09ba916ffafd72db7348db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746210581","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_d